# [[.SiteName]]

A website built on [github.com/tsawler/cms](https://github.com/tsawler/cms),
generated with `cms init`.

## Running it

```sh
docker compose up -d       # start [[.EngineLabel]]
go mod tidy                # resolve dependencies
[[if .Tailwind]]go generate .              # compile static/site.css (needs the tailwindcss CLI)
[[end]]go run .                   # http://localhost:4000
```

Then sign in at <http://localhost:4000/admin/> with the
`CMS_ADMIN_EMAIL` / `CMS_ADMIN_PASSWORD` from `.env` — change the password
straight away. The admin account is created on first startup only.

Once signed in, visit the public site: pages are edited **in place**, by
clicking the text on the page itself.

## Layout

```
[[.Program]]/
├── main.go              # yours — server, database, template list
├── .env                 # local config, gitignored
├── docker-compose.yml   # development database[[if .Captcha]] and CAPTCHA[[end]]
[[if .Tailwind]]├── gen.go               # go:generate line for the stylesheet
├── tailwind-content.sh  # rebuilds CSS for classes typed into content
├── assets/input.css     # Tailwind input
├── static/site.css      # compiled output, gitignored
[[end]]└── templates/
    ├── base.gohtml      # shared layout
    └── pages/           # the templates editors can choose
        ├── home.gohtml
        ├── standard.gohtml
        ├── canvas.gohtml
[[if .Blog]]        ├── blog.gohtml      # paginated listing
        ├── news.gohtml      # listing with hand-built pagination
        └── post.gohtml      # a single blog or news post
[[end]]```

## Adding a page template

Drop a file in `templates/pages/`, then add a line to `cfg.PageTemplates`
in `main.go`. The template funcs that make a region editable:

| Func | What it is |
| --- | --- |
| `{{cmsText "key"}}` | one editable line of plain text |
| `{{cmsRegion "key"}}` | a block of editable rich text |
| `{{cmsImage "key"}}` | an editable image URL |
| `{{cmsSections "key"}}` | blocks the editor can add and reorder |
| `{{cmsTitle}}` | the page title, editable in place |
| `{{cmsNav "main"}}` | a menu managed in the admin area |
| `{{cmsHead}}` / `{{cmsScripts}}` | required, in `base.gohtml` |

Keys are per page, so two templates may reuse the same name freely.

## Optional features

All configured from `.env`, all off until you set them: the media library
(`S3_*`), the login CAPTCHA (`CAP_*`), and content-driven Tailwind
rebuilds (`CMS_TAILWIND_COMMAND`). See the comments in `.env` and the
module's README for the full variable table.
